+/* Hades: the version of Dolby Vision display management that the display reads, from its Dolby
+ * VSVDB: with 2 or 3 the frames prepared from now on carry the content mapping v2.9 part of their
+ * metadata only (levels 1, 2, 4 and 5; see dvbridge_dv::cm29_only in dvbridge_metadata.h); with 4
