+    /* Hades: the display reads Dolby Vision display management 2 or 3 (its Dolby VSVDB says so):
+     * the frames carry the content mapping v2.9 part of their metadata, levels 1, 2, 4 and 5, and
+     * the v4.0 part, levels 3, 8 to 11 and 254, is left out. An RPU carries the two parts as two
+     * payloads, the second where a reader of v2.9 does not look (FFmpeg, dovi_rpudec.c:
